 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "stauden.de・品種: 咲き終わった花茎を株元の葉まで切る（試作のホスタ 'Gold Standard' と同じ線引き）。RHS は傷んだ葉の除去と秋の片付けのみ。文が同じ 'Abiqua Drinking Gourd' と同じ。花後の根拠は stauden.de の1件だけ。機械の A から変更",
  "management_type_quote": "Rückschnitt abgeblühter Stängel bis zum grundständigen Blattschopf",
  "management_type_by_matching": "A 放任型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/品種] Greenish-yellow margins may scorch in too much sun.\n[NC State/属] In the south it is best to plant hosta in full shade or dappled shade so that the foliage colors will be more vibrant and won't develop leaf burn.\n[NC State/属] Hosta plantaginea  originated in China and is very fragrant and tolerates heat.\n[Walters/品種] Sun will cause leaf scorching.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or North-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": null,
  "mixing_evidence": "[stauden.de・品種] Wuchsverhalten: horstig, lockerhorstig, horstbildend",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[MBG・品種] It is a clump-forming perennial that typically matures in a spreading foliage mound to 24\" tall and to 48-60\" wide.",
